  "bodyHash": "b6db8963e90a4872",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d80488fb-70a1-409a-81df-dbbc3b8b841c.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>Sodium Options Mod Compat</strong> 使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium-options-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Options API</a>，為各種缺乏此功能的渲染相關模組新增 Sodium 顯示設定。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103431/description_81b22102-8cb4-4adc-843f-5a033bb00637.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/SodiumOptionsModCompat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1103431/description_7d2b55fa-b9e2-4316-9e65-5b76a7178843.png\"></p>\n<p>目前已支援以下模組的相容性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Entity Texture Features</li>\n<li>Entity Model Features</li>\n<li>DynamicFPS</li>\n<li>Continuity（於 Fabric 原生支援，並於 Forge 透過 Connector 支援）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本模組部分移植自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fembyui\" rel=\"nofollow\">EmbeddiumUI</a>，並新增其他模組支援，同時移植至使用跨平台 <strong>Sodium Options API</strong> 以支援以下版本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forge 版 Embeddium</li>\n<li>1.20.1 Fabric Sodium 0.5</li>\n<li>1.21.1 Fabric/NeoForge Sodium 0.6</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若您有希望新增至 Sodium 顯示設定的渲染相關模組建議，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/SodiumOptionsModCompat/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issue</a> 提出功能請求。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
